{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "102", "sample_idx": 4, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "\"Honestly, Beatrice, are you *sure* about this?\" Mark asked, pulling his sweatshirt tighter around him. He slumped against the doorframe.\n\nBeatrice, resplendent in a shimmering emerald green ball gown, adjusted a delicate strand of pearls. \"Of *course* I'm sure, Mark! It's the annual Starlight Soiree. It’s a tradition! And besides,\" she added with a playful wink, \"it's good to dress up sometimes.\"\n\nMark sighed. \"Traditions are overrated. And I feel incredibly conspicuous. Everyone else will be… well, you know. *Fancy*.\"\n\n\"Don't be silly. It's a very relaxed atmosphere. Think champagne and polite conversation, not stiff formality. And I *wanted* you to come. It wouldn't be the same without you.\" Beatrice smoothed down her gown, a small smile playing on her lips. \"Besides, I need someone to navigate the small talk with. You're much better at that than I am.\"\n\n\"I just… I don’t understand the point of all this. The gowns, the masks, the forced smiles.\"\n\n\"The point is to have fun, Mark! To be a little bit whimsical. To escape the everyday for a few hours.\" Beatrice reached out and gently touched his arm. \"Come on. Let's go. Think of it as an adventure.\"\n\nMark reluctantly pushed himself off the doorframe. \"An adventure in uncomfortable shoes, apparently.\"\n\n* He muttered something about needing a stronger drink than champagne.\n* Beatrice insisted he at least try to smile and mingle.\n* Mark worried about tripping in his rented dress shoes.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"", "logprob": -0.06898927688598633}, {"token": "Honestly", "logprob": -1.519942045211792}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -1.3828182090946939e-05}, {"token": "▁Beatrice", "logprob": -0.06729019433259964}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.0040906332433223724}, {"token": "▁are", "logprob": -0.015815770253539085}, {"token": "▁you", "logprob": -3.957670196541585e-05}, {"t